    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Topological sort</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/course-schedule-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 210</a></div>\n  <h1>Course Schedule II</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: a course can be taken once its last prerequisite is done, so repeatedly take a course with in-degree 0 (Kahn's algorithm); if some courses never reach 0 they sit on a cycle and the answer is empty. O(V + E) time and space.</p>\n"
